@* ============================================================
   Block: carousel-icon-showcase
   Title: Animated Icon Library Carousel
   Description: Animated icon library browser carousel with categorized icon grids, click-to-copy names, and staggered entrance animations
   Dependencies: CarouselCn, ButtonCn, LucideArrowRightCn, LucideBookOpenCn, LucideBugCn, LucideCameraCn, LucideCheckCn, LucideChevronDownCn, LucideCodeCn, LucideCompassCn, LucideDatabaseCn, LucideFileTextCn, LucideGitBranchCn, LucideGlobeCn, LucideGridCn, LucideHeadphonesCn, LucideHomeCn, LucideImageCn, LucideLayersCn, LucideMailCn, LucideMapCn, LucideMenuCn, LucideMessageCircleCn, LucideMicCn, LucideMonitorCn, LucideMusicCn, LucideNavigationCn, LucidePhoneCn, LucidePlayCn, LucideSearchCn, LucideSendCn, LucideSettingsCn, LucideTerminalCn, LucideTypeCn, LucideUserCn, LucideVideoCn, LucideVolume2Cn, LucideWifiCn
   Source: original/blocks/carousel/carousel-icon-showcase.tsx
